<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <!--
    The live Claude core lane (CARD-1545, tests/live-lanes.json "core"): the six tests that drive a real Claude, and only
    the helpers they need. The owner (2026-11-26): "the source files for this digest should all be in an isolated project
    dedicated to running real Claude". No nightly or rc suite runs this assembly (test-execution-policy.json lists it as a
    child of Antiphon.Tests, which stages it only to list its discovery for the core roster); the live lane is its runner,
    and every test here still skips without the lane's admitted context. Nothing under scripts/ is referenced.
  -->
